# Four beads on paper, circle radius 20 at x 30, 92, 154, 216. Every instance of def bead carries the def's fx shadow 5,5 blur:2, which runs first. The call site's own fx run after the def's.
# 1. Blue bead with no call-site fx: a crisp blue circle with a soft blue-gray shadow to the lower right.
# 2. Green bead with outline 4 at the call site: the same green circle and shadow, plus a crisp dark ink ring around it.
# 3. Red bead with adjust hue:120 at the call site: the circle is green, and its shadow shifts hue with it, so the shadow is green-gray instead of red-gray.
# 4. Gold bead with blur 3 at the call site: the circle is soft at its edge and its shadow is blurred along with it.
@artboard 256x96
@target fx/def_call.png

def bead size:20 tone:p.blue
  circle size fill:tone
  fx shadow 5,5 blur:2

bead at:30,40
bead at:92,40 tone:p.green
  fx outline 4 color:p.ink
bead at:154,40 tone:p.red
  fx adjust hue:120
bead at:216,40 tone:p.gold
  fx blur 3
